WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:17.320
and his companions were tied up in a room in the abbey.

2
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:22.223
"I will deal with you all in the morning," said the Great Immortal.

3
00:00:23.003 --> 00:00:25.004
He turned around and left the room.

4
00:00:29.687 --> 00:00:31.468
The Tang Monk began to cry.

5
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.823
"It's bad enough that there are dangers along the journey," he said.

6
00:00:36.843 --> 00:00:41.246
"But my own companions are causing trouble for me!"

7
00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:45.049
down, Master," said Wukong.

8
00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:46.790
"We'll get out of this."

9
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:52.914
"Master, this is all Wukong's fault," said Bajie.

10
00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:56.617
"He stole the ginseng fruit, and he knocked down the tree."

11
00:00:56.637 --> 00:00:59.479
"Stealing the fruit was your idea!"

12
00:00:59.799 --> 00:01:00.620
shouted the monkey.

13
00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.862
"I can't help it if I was hungry," said Bajie.

14
00:01:04.882 --> 00:01:07.464
"You should have refused to steal it."

15
00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:12.908
"Let's stop arguing and figure out how to escape," said Wujing.

16
00:01:12.928 --> 00:01:15.970
"I have a plan," said Wukong.

17
00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:19.612
"But we must wait until the Great Immortal is asleep."

18
00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:26.256
Late that night Wukong recited a spell.

19
00:01:27.357 --> 00:01:31.320
He shrank to the size of a pea and then slipped out from his ropes.

20
00:01:32.172 --> 00:01:34.013
He quickly untied his friends.

21
00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:37.696
"Let's go," he whispered.

22
00:01:39.197 --> 00:01:42.299
The group tiptoed through the dark and silent abbey.

23
00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:47.102
When they got outside, the sun was beginning to rise.

24
00:01:47.122 --> 00:01:53.127
"That was easy," said Bajie as they walked down the road.

25
00:01:53.147 --> 00:01:57.790
"I hope you all learned a lesson from this," said the Tang Monk.

26
00:01:59.691 --> 00:02:00.712
a voice boomed.

27
00:02:01.512 --> 00:02:03.494
"You can't escape from me!"

28
00:02:04.715 --> 00:02:06.576
The Great Immortal flew toward them.

29
00:02:07.797 --> 00:02:10.540
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and swung.

30
00:02:11.781 --> 00:02:13.902
The Great Immortal moved out of the way.

31
00:02:15.003 --> 00:02:19.127
Bajie struck with his rake, and Wujing stabbed with his spear.

32
00:02:19.907 --> 00:02:21.589
But the Great Immortal was fast.

33
00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.113
He waved his arm, and his sleeve shot toward the group.

34
00:02:28.094 --> 00:02:30.416
Once again the travelers were swept up.

35
00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:38.678
Back at the abbey, the Great Immortal told his priests to start a fire.

36
00:02:38.698 --> 00:02:43.320
"Bring out a large frying pan," said the Great Immortal.

37
00:02:44.661 --> 00:02:46.302
going to fry these criminals.

38
00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:49.423
Let's start with Sun Wukong."

39
00:02:51.844 --> 00:02:55.626
The priests carried an enormous frying pan into the room.

40
00:02:56.586 --> 00:02:58.187
They placed it over the fire.

41
00:02:58.207 --> 00:03:00.968
"Uh-oh," thought Wukong.

42
00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.922
"I can sit on that frying pan all day and not get hurt at all.

43
00:03:06.043 --> 00:03:07.464
the Tang Monk is mortal.

44
00:03:08.245 --> 00:03:09.306
He'll be burned to a crisp!"

45
00:03:12.408 --> 00:03:14.990
He spotted a statue of a lion nearby.

46
00:03:16.291 --> 00:03:21.174
The monkey recited a quick spell and made the statue look exactly like himself.

47
00:03:21.895 --> 00:03:23.276
Then he disappeared.

48
00:03:23.296 --> 00:03:27.719
"Throw Sun Wukong into the frying pan!"

49
00:03:27.919 --> 00:03:28.960
said the Great Immortal.

50
00:03:30.316 --> 00:03:34.459
Thinking the statue was Wukong, the two priests tried to lift it.

51
00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:42.064
"This monkey is much heavier than he looks," said one priest, breathing heavily.

52
00:03:42.084 --> 00:03:45.667
"Yes," said the other priest, panting.

53
00:03:47.668 --> 00:03:51.371
They finally dragged the statue to the frying pan and dropped it in.

54
00:03:54.853 --> 00:03:56.734
The frying pan broke in half.

55
00:03:56.754 --> 00:03:58.796
"The monkey tricked us!"

56
00:03:59.228 --> 00:04:00.528
shouted the Great Immortal.

57
00:04:01.329 --> 00:04:03.589
"He made that statue look like himself!"

58
00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:05.830
rotten monkey!"

59
00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.190
cried Bajie.

60
00:04:08.251 --> 00:04:09.511
"He escaped without us!"

61
00:04:09.591 --> 00:04:12.532
"Do you really think he left us?"

62
00:04:13.012 --> 00:04:13.932
asked the Tang Monk.

63
00:04:15.012 --> 00:04:15.833
"Look around!"

64
00:04:16.173 --> 00:04:17.013
said Bajie.

65
00:04:17.033 --> 00:04:18.553
"He's gone!

66
00:04:19.074 --> 00:04:21.634
He probably returned to the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

67
00:04:22.715 --> 00:04:25.275
I'm sure he's playing in a field of flowers right now.

68
00:04:26.035 --> 00:04:27.656
Meanwhile we're trapped here!"

69
00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:31.777
"I don't think he would leave us," said Wujing.

70
00:04:34.418 --> 00:04:36.219
The Tang Monk started to cry.

71
00:04:36.899 --> 00:04:38.960
The Great Immortal shook with anger.

72
00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:42.582
"It's bad enough that Sun Wukong wanted to escape.

73
00:04:43.382 --> 00:04:46.304
did he really have to break my frying pan too?"

74
00:04:46.964 --> 00:04:49.225
He stamped his foot.

75
00:04:49.285 --> 00:04:51.086
"Bring out another frying pan.

76
00:04:51.986 --> 00:04:55.808
We'll fry his companions, starting with the Tang Monk!"
